Modifications by Menlo Cloud include (non-exhaustive): the Kamaji hosted
control plane (KamajiControlPlane replacing KubeadmControlPlane), the
management-side OpenStack cloud-controller-manager, external-dns/OIDC/certSAN
wiring, flavor-by-ID machine templates, surge-first rollout defaults, and the
vendored cluster-addons-menlo subchart.

